# Memory Bank

This project's memory resets between sessions. At the start of every non-trivial task, read the files in `memory-bank/` (at least `activeContext.md` and `progress.md`). Update them when work focus, decisions, or status change.

## Core files

1. `memory-bank/projectbrief.md` — scope and goals
2. `memory-bank/productContext.md` — why the product exists
3. `memory-bank/activeContext.md` — current focus and recent decisions
4. `memory-bank/systemPatterns.md` — architecture patterns
5. `memory-bank/techContext.md` — stack and setup
6. `memory-bank/progress.md` — what works / what's left

When the user says "update memory bank", refresh these files from the current conversation.
